ass=\"ph-in\"><div><p class=\"crumb ph-a\"><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/\">Engineering Staffing</a> / Architectural BIM Engineers</p><h1 class=\"h1 ph-a long\">Architectural BIM engineers <em>for documentation and coordination.</em></h1></div><p class=\"lead ph-a\">Engineers who carry the architectural model through technical design, coordination and documentation.</p></div></section><section class=\"paper pad\"><div class=\"wrap sd\">\n  <div><p class=\"lab\">Architecture</p><p class=\"big\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Architectural BIM Engineers placed onsite, remotely or as part of a dedicated team, <em>each one assessed before you meet them.</em></p>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:36px;display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><a class=\"btn dark\" href=\"/request-talent/?service=Architectural%20BIM%20Engineers\">Request Architectural BIM Engineers <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"sdside\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Roles we place</p><ul class=\"deliv\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><li>Architectural BIM Engineer</li><li>Senior Architectural BIM Engineer</li><li>Architectural BIM Coordinator</li><li>Architectural BIM Modeler</li></ul></div></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"coal pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">On the project</p><h2 class=\"h2\">What they <em>do for you.</em></h2></div></div>\n  <div class=\"qual qual-dark\">\n    <div class=\"rv ok\"><p class=\"lab\">Typical responsibilities</p><ul><li>Develop technical design models from the architect&#039;s concept</li><li>Model walls, floors, ceilings, stairs, facades and openings to the agreed LOD</li><li>Coordinate architectural elements with structure and MEP in clash cycles</li><li>Produce GA plans, sections, elevations, details and door and finish schedules</li><li>Update models and sheets from consultant comments and RFIs</li></ul></div>\n    <div class=\"rv\"><p class=\"lab\">Software we assess</p><div class=\"chiprow ink-chips\"><span>Revit</span><span>Navisworks</span><span>ACC</span><span>AutoCAD</span><span>Dynamo</span></div></div>\n    <div class=\"rv\"><p class=\"lab\">How they can work</p><ul class=\"plain\"><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/onsite/\">Onsite BIM Staffing</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/remote/\">Remote BIM Staffing</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/outsourcing/\">BIM Resource Outsourcing</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/dedicated-teams/\">Dedicated BIM Teams</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/staff-augmentation/\">BIM Staff Augmentation</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/mobilization/\">BIM Workforce Mobilization</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/workforce-continuity/\">BIM Workforce Continuity</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/temporary/\">Temporary BIM Staffing</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/long-term/\">Long-Term BIM Staffing</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/technical-recruitment/\">BIM Technical Recruitment</a></li></ul></div>\n  </div>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Need a package instead?</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Related <em>BIM services.</em></h2></div><a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"/bim-services/\">All BIM services <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n  <ul class=\"rel\"><li><a href=\"/bim-services/architectural-bim/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Architectural BIM</b><span>Architecture</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-services/bim-coordination/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Coordination</b><span>Coordination</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-services/cad-to-bim/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>CAD to BIM Conversion</b><span>Conversion</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"paper pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\">